# #Scene 1\:
# #
# #context: mc meets an old friend of the host (Eugenia aka Gena), trying to catch up after host returned from their 6 years abroad
# #
audio music "res://audio/atmos/atmos_city.mp3"
You see a frail-looking human frantically approaching you, seemingly intending to initiate "conversation".

join Eugenia center

Eugenia (surprised): Meade?[pause=0.5] Oh my God, *Meade*, is that you, choom?[pause=0.2] It's me, *Eugenia*! From *high school*, *remember*?

set {Eugenia_Name} = "Eugenia"
...

Eugenia (looking_at_player): Have you been avoiding me or why haven't you come by *the café* to say *hi* to me in what feels like ages??? Here *I* was, thinking you died out there or something, *choom*! I was *worried about you*, you know?

You aren't sure why, but for whatever reason you can understand every word that human is saying.

Must be some leftover information that the language center of your host's brain miraculously kept active long enough for you to assimilate into the mycelium network.

label FirstReply

[b][i]You can NOT afford to be discovered, lest you want your short existence in human society to end prematurely, yet you don't quite know how to speak human language yet.[/i][/b]

[b][i]Maybe you can use the words the human was saying to your advantage by memorizing them and then repeating them back to them…[/i][/b]

[signal arg="scramble_01"]


if {Sentence_Score} < 5.0:
	
	Eugenia (surprised): Huh? What?
	
	jump FirstReply
elif {Sentence_Score} > 10.0:
	set {Sentence_Score} = 10.0

set {Scores.Eugenia_Score} = {Scores.Eugenia_Score} + max(10,{Sentence_Score})
set {Sentence_Score} = 0


Eugenia (looking_right): Ok so it seems like you do remember me, but not the *language* we're speaking…[pause=0.5]
Eugenia (surprised): Did those *6 years abroad* really make you *forget* how to *speak* our language that much? I mean, *yes*, I *understand*, being in a foreign country for that long without speaking your native tongue might degrade your skills over time but yikes… [pause=1]
Eugenia (looking_at_player): I guess ol' *Gena* will have to refresh the *memories* trapped in that noggin of yours, choom!

Eugenia (surprised): Dang, I need to hurry back to work, didn't realize I spent most of my break talking to you.
Eugenia (looking_right): I suppose I'll see you some other time, Meade?

(word scramble menu) //this time scripted, you only have "yes", "Eugenia" and "Gena" as option

set {Scores.Total_Score} = {Scores.Total_Score} + {Scores.Eugenia_Score}